This project adapts the pi0.5 model architecture and tokenizer format from
Physical Intelligence's OpenPI project and the user's local openpi_old snapshot.
Upstream: https://github.com/Physical-Intelligence/openpi

Vendored Gemma/SigLIP implementations originate from the OpenPI modifications
to Hugging Face Transformers 4.53.2. Copyright and Apache-2.0 notices are retained
in the individual files. Relative imports were adapted to package-local modules;
the installed transformers distribution is not modified. The JAX tensor conversion functions are adapted from the OpenPI conversion example.
Source file hashes are
recorded in docs/vendor_provenance.json.

The NAVSIM trajectory convention and optional agent interface follow
https://github.com/autonomousvision/navsim .

The base checkpoint derives from PaliGemma/Gemma and is subject to the Gemma
Terms of Use in LICENSE_GEMMA.txt. The Apache-2.0 license for source code does
not replace the model terms.
